{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chair Debiti is the first chairbuilder roguelike, where every part of the chair can be replaced, improved, and broken. Flip your customized chair to earn money and avoid damnation.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/4a093b9014ed2234cc3cd859c4c34186.poster.avif?t=1758373051\" width=280 height=258 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/4a093b9014ed2234cc3cd859c4c34186.webm?t=1758373051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/4a093b9014ed2234cc3cd859c4c34186.mp4?t=1758373051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But flipping the chair is not the only way to earn money, there are multiple minigames that help boost your income dramatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/af02db0f5cc56df890cebc8f3fe9e086.poster.avif?t=1758373051\" width=672 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/af02db0f5cc56df890cebc8f3fe9e086.webm?t=1758373051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/af02db0f5cc56df890cebc8f3fe9e086.mp4?t=1758373051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minigames</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blackjack - Draw cards to hit blackjack and multiply your income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fishing - Cast your line to reel in various aquatic creatures and the occasional garbage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mining - Dig into the ground to excavate gems and rare earth metals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock Market - Buy, sell, and manipulate stocks, or crash the market and reap the benefits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spellcasting - Buy spell scrolls and perform their spell motions to harness powerful magic.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minions - Allocate minions to various jobs you don't want to do yourself</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/8648fe4e66cf6198ce05430ad776c42b.poster.avif?t=1758373051\" width=230 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/8648fe4e66cf6198ce05430ad776c42b.webm?t=1758373051\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3967160/extras/8648fe4e66cf6198ce05430ad776c42b.mp4?t=1758373051\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>80+</strong> parts to upgrade your chair with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70+</strong>\u00a0items to further scale your run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An additional<strong> 80+</strong>\u00a0parts, items, and monsters to unlock for use in future runs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 </strong>unique characters, each offering a different  playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>33</strong> achievements to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A statistics room that upgrades as your stats increase</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Challenge Accepted","p